{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-9-4:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_9_4\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p-irc-applicability-decision-1\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"根据已确认项目事实（irc.applicable=false），本项目不设立独立评审委员会（IRC）。本节分别声明 IRC 适用性判定与设立义务：当前适用性判定为“不适用”，设立义务不触发。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p-irc-establishment-obligation-2\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"因适用性判定为不适用，本项目无需制定或提交 IRC 章程、独立性安排、评审范围与终点、裁定方法与工具版本、角色与利益冲突管理等设立要素；上述设立要素在本项目中不适用。若后续项目事实条件发生变更，应重新判定 IRC 适用性，并在判定为适用时逐项补充上述设立要素。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p-irc-boundary-and-examples-3\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"IRC 不得与安全性/数据监查委员会混同。RECIST 1.1、肿瘤影像及 CD 传输等仅可作为相关裁定方法的示例，不构成通用裁定方法；本项目当前未设立 IRC，亦不将任何示例性方法作为本项目 IRC 裁定方法。未设立 IRC 不降低试验参与者安全与数据完整性要求。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"e9adde7a6e7e4e55af3f394b3b0e03298a96b7b22a671d302101cbd9a6156f5c"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:9f5edcb5e328f0804c7576714b634bcd51feb087f51d079d19c00e75771efb08:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:9f5edcb5e328f0804c7576714b634bcd51feb087f51d079d19c00e75771efb08:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"c6b175aea214aa50fc697bed3ff1bca94e6655d3f67c23f7f4d9938ff293e294","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab81409e5aefa1e","provider_session_id":"91b932ed-24cb-4e2c-b973-d6efff64696b","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"sc